## Focus areas
- **Tools:** "I have the tools to do my job" fell from 64% to 59% favorable.
- **Workload:** "Workload is sustainable" fell from 52% to 48% favorable.

! Support has the lowest engagement at 69%. A listening session is set for 2026-10-28.
